#: ../../source/reference/liteframe/groupby.rst:7
msgid ""
"GroupBy objects are returned by :meth:`maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame."
"groupby`. Aggregation output is always column-based (equivalent to ``as_"
"index=False``) with no MultiIndex — group keys are returned as regular "
"columns."
msgstr ""
"GroupBy 对象由 :meth:`maxframe.liteframe.LiteFrame.groupby` 返回。聚合"
"输出始终基于列（相当于 ``as_index=False``），没有多级索引——分组键作为常规"
"列返回。"

